    "notes": "The cottage stool: a round seat on four short legs. Sitting on furniture is out of scope: MSM has no seat yet, so the stool is for looks.. msm:shape with custom boxes (in pixels, 0 to 16) gives it the same outline and collision as its model, so it is see-through where it is empty, and it drops itself. msm:flammable lets fire burn it as it burns planks.",
